      "statement": "Profile adoption and configuration admission remain separate. Only Product authority adopts, recording the act in its basis; cut inclusion merely provides availability. The smallest existing authority owning each material configuration decision admits it without creating authority. Goals/admitted work authority owns bounded work selection; Product owns Product-wide capability/acceptance meaning; requirements own constitutional behaviour; accepted design owns realisation structure/specialist design frames; identity/release owners retain declared decisions; bounded proxy stays inside its grant. Product basis cites every material configuration source without collapsing them into new local-axiom authority.",
